Aim: Explore Docker commands for container management.

Docker installation

Install docker from official page
Install WSL: wsl --version
wsl --install
wsl --version(Check version)
Restart the computer

Open docker

Docker Commands

Command 1: docker –version
Command 2: docker info
Command 3: docker images
Command 4: docker ps -a
Command 5: docker pull hello-world
Command 6: docker run hello-world
Command 7: docker image ls
Command 8: docker container ls -a
Command 9: docker system df
Command 10: docker stop id
Command 11: docker rm id
Command 12: docker rmi hello-world
